    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/806880/extras/8a0adacdd237eeb8795132539a5b9e19.webp?t=1545822631\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DJ Mole</strong></h2> <br><strong>DJ Mole is a cute little mole that loves music.</strong><br><br>He goes on a search for the best vinyl of the world to put on a big party for all his friends from the farm.<br><br>A puzzle game with simple mechanics and instant and intuitive gameplay!<br>Collect all the vinyl by moving the coloured blocks wisely.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/806880/extras/267beebf06fe7d7ed84b904e672df6c8.avif?t=1545822631\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES :</strong></h2><br><strong>- Hours of gameplay to complete all levels!</strong><br><strong>- Level-based scoring system based on moves optimization</strong><br><strong>- Alternative ways to complete each level</strong><br>- More than 60 highly addictive levels spread between 3 different worlds<br>- Collect bonuses<br>- Open doors<br>- Use teleporters<br>- A nice and friendly mole!",
